WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.130
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:17.010
Last time: Sets & Venn diagrams

3
00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:26.190
Chapter 5 · Solving Puzzles Step by Step

4
00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:36.470
A secret trick: no guessing!

5
00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:40.620
Detective cap on. Let's go!

6
00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:54.400
Chintu, Arjun and Zoya: seats 1, 2, 3

7
00:00:54.400 --> 00:01:05.160
Clue 1: Zoya is last · Clue 2: Chintu not first

8
00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:20.000
A quick guess breaks clue 1!

9
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:27.030
How do we solve it without guessing?

10
00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:33.720
CLUE = a small fact that helps

11
00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:41.130
Logic puzzle: think step by step, no guessing

12
00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:55.000
Use a clue · Cross out · Next clue

13
00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:04.970
With 3 seats, last = seat 3

14
00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:20.180
Clue 1: Zoya → seat 3. Cross out the rest.

15
00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:30.430
Clue 2: not seat 1, so Chintu → seat 2

16
00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:43.940
Arjun 1 · Chintu 2 · Zoya 3. Solved!

17
00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:53.940
Riya, Sam, Tara · hat, bag, bottle

18
00:02:53.940 --> 00:03:04.400
Clue 1: Sam owns the bag

19
00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:14.590
Clue 2: Riya has no hat → the bottle

20
00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:20.050
So who owns the hat?

21
00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:27.450
Only the hat and Tara are left → Tara!

22
00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:37.130
Pinky taller than Golu · Golu taller than Tinku

23
00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:42.330
Who is the shortest?

24
00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:56.010
Pinky, Golu, Tinku → Tinku is the shortest

25
00:03:56.010 --> 00:04:14.110
4×4 · each row & column has 1, 2, 3, 4 once

26
00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:23.110
Row: 1, 2, __, 4. What's missing?

27
00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:29.770
1, 2 and 4 are used → 3!

28
00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:39.150
Star, circle, triangle, __. Which shape?

29
00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:43.250
The square! Each shape just once.

30
00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:59.530
Row 2: 3, 4, __, 2. What goes in?

31
00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:06.040
Row 2 already has 3, 4, 2 → it needs 1

32
00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:15.930
Check the column: above is 3. It fits!

33
00:05:15.930 --> 00:05:24.490
Write the clue next to each answer

34
00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:32.750
Seat 3 = Zoya (clue 1) · Seat 2 = Chintu (clue 2)

35
00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:43.200
Written clues help you check your answer

36
00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:47.750
Your turn: practice check

37
00:05:47.750 --> 00:06:03.690
Ravi not first · Meera last. Who is first?

38
00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:17.630
Meera 3 · Ravi 2 · Neha 1 → Neha is first!

39
00:06:17.630 --> 00:06:23.040
Use one clue at a time

40
00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:26.620
Cross out what can't be true

41
00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:31.510
Sudoku-lite: each number once per row & column

42
00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:35.240
Write down the clues you used

43
00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:50.590
Chapter 5 done · Unit 2 complete!

44
00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:57.390
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
